--- !u!114 &566057214
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 566057212}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e50ba17086dd0d441b315907b988fb9a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueTrigger
  manager: {fileID: 1626268670}
  lines:
  - "You\u2019re here. Good."
  - "This place\u2026 hasn\u2019t seen light in decades. Forgotten corridors, sealed
    doors\u2026 and walls that remember every sound, every step."
  - "It wasn\u2019t always empty. Once\u2026 long ago\u2026 this was a decontainment
    zone."
  - "A place where things\u2026 escaped. Things that shouldn\u2019t exist\u2026 or
    live. We needed a team\u2026 a team of technicians\u2026 to contain it, to seal
    it"
  - 
  - "And you are that team. Or at least\u2026 the last one they sent"
  - "The button you\u2019re about to press\u2026 it is not a switch. It is a choice.
    One that cannot be undone."
  - "Once pressed\u2026 the air will change\u2026 and so will you. Some never came
    back. Some\u2026 never even realized they were gone."
  - "Your hands\u2026 your breath\u2026 your thoughts\u2026 all belong now. It begins
    when you press. There is no undoing what you will start."
  - 
  - "120 seconds. One hundred twenty seconds\u2026 to move, to act\u2026 to survive\u2026
    if you can. And when the clock ends\u2026 you will understand why they never
    returned"
  - 
  - "Press it\u2026 and step forward. Or do nothing\u2026 and it will step for you.
    Either way\u2026 you are already counted."
  voices:
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: a2fe71823deea5d479110d0f704a090e, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: e256b05671897aa47a2a1a8088b5bed9, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 88fb5fc52f423964caa1a392f333157d, type: 3}
